    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fine-tuned Physics Simulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll feel every impact as objects respond realistically to your actions. Watch as your moves create natural, unpredictable chain reactions that change the game with each decision you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Physics-bending Powers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll wield abilities that let you break the rules. Create force fields, manipulate momentum, and bend spatial properties to transform the environment and devise strategies limited only by your imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your powers to eliminate the competition, trigger chain reactions, race, play football, and much, MUCH more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tap Into Childhood Excitement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll reconnect with that same wonder you felt playing with marbles as a kid, now enhanced with extraordinary powers. The familiar thrill of a perfect shot combined with the strategic depth of your power cards creates a game that's instantly nostalgic yet refreshingly new.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fine-tuned Physics Simulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll feel every impact as objects respond realistically to your actions. Watch as your moves create natural, unpredictable chain reactions that change the game with each decision you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Physics-bending Powers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll wield abilities that let you break the rules. Create force fields, manipulate momentum, and bend spatial properties to transform the environment and devise strategies limited only by your imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your powers to eliminate the competition, trigger chain reactions, race, play football, and much, MUCH more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tap Into Childhood Excitement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll reconnect with that same wonder you felt playing with marbles as a kid, now enhanced with extraordinary powers. The familiar thrill of a perfect shot combined with the strategic depth of your power cards creates a game that's instantly nostalgic yet refreshingly new.</p>",
    "short_description": "Experience the thrill of a marbles tabletop game with physics-bending powers! Dive into this turn-based multiplayer action, challenging friends, family, strangers, or Bots across diverse game modes and challenges. It's all about calculated moves and chaotic fun!",
